<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan March wholesale prices at 13.40 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Pakistan March wholesale prices at 13.40 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's wholesale price index fell to 13.40 percent in March year-on-year from 15.68 percent in February, the Federal Bureau of Statistics said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The index, using 1990/91 as a base year, fell 0.29 percent to 204.85 from 205.44 in February. The index stood at 180.64 in March 1996.</p>
<p>					  March     Feb	  March 1996</p>
<p>WHOLESALE PRICE  base 1990/91   204.85   205.44	 180.64</p>
<p>    Month-on-month		  -0.29    +0.65	    n/a</p>
<p>    Year-on-year		   +13.40   +15.68	    n/a</p>
<p>-- Islamabad newsroom 9251-274757</p>
